        "procedure": "Under rigorous exclusion of air and water (Schlenk/glovebox), a solution of H[NSiMe3(Ar)] (50 mg, 0.20 mmol) in n-hexane (1 ml) was added to a suspension of 1/n [LuMe3]n (1-Lu) (44 mg, 0.20 mmol) in n-hexane (1 ml) at ambient temperature under vigorous stirring. To the orange mixture thf (1 ml) was slowly added. After ~30 min the mixture became clear and was stirred for an additional 60 min at ambient temperature. The orange solution was filtered and single crystals of 4-Lu were obtained from the thf/n-hexane solution at −35 °C.",
